sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 👤 Usuario
    participant W as ⚡ Worker
    participant DB as 🐘 Neon
    participant P as 🔑 Privy
    participant PM as ⛽ Paymaster (Alchemy)
    participant M as ⛓️ Monad

    U->>W: POST /wallet/send<br/>Cookie + Idempotency-Key
    W->>DB: verificar session
    DB-->>W: user + wallet
    W->>DB: check Idempotency-Key
    DB-->>W: primera vez

    W->>W: Policy Engine<br/>max_single · velocity · allowlist
    W-->>U: 200 (preview) o 202 (confirm)

    U->>W: confirmar
    W->>P: firmar (wallet embedded)
    P->>PM: rutear gas sponsorship
    PM-->>P: UserOp firmada
    P->>M: broadcast tx
    M-->>P: txHash
    P-->>W: { txHash, gasUsed }

    W->>DB: INSERT movements
    W->>DB: INSERT idempotency_keys
    W->>DB: UPDATE wallets.balance
    W-->>U: 200 { movement, newBalance }